# Preset YAML writes

Preset files are **`config.yaml`** under `projects/<slug>/`. Mutations must preserve `#` comments and survive concurrent writers.

## Do

- Use `update_preset_yaml_tree(path, mutator)` from `core/preset/io.py`.
- Use `preset_yaml_transaction(path)` for multi-step locked edits.
- Atomic write via `dump_preset_yaml_document` (`.partial` temp + replace).

## Callers

- `serve/sites.py` — add/update/delete sites

## Avoid

- Direct `open(preset).write(...)` or stdlib `yaml.dump`.
- Unlocked read-modify-write races.
